          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP237 Edmonton - RR Museum&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Posted Coordinates: N53° 42.071 W113° 23.601

My GPSr Coordinates: N53° 42.073 W113° 23.603&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We followed a manure truck in leaving dust and tangible taste in its wake and arrived at the currently closed museum.  Was a little worried about finding this cap due to some logs, but after a quick examination the divot was found easily with the scarred up cap.  Unfortunately, a little too much water was used i the not draining divot so to get the numbers was a challenge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may be back this way as the kids (young and old enjoy trains)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap, outforthehunt!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
